node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.log

# Screenshots dropped next to the app while debugging - browser-*, hermes-*, opening-* and
# friends. Forty-two of them had accumulated here, and twenty-nine more are already tracked
# from before this rule, which it does not affect.
#
# The leading slash matters: it pins this to modern/web itself, so public/, oracle/captured/
# and tools/screenshots/ - all of which hold PNGs on purpose - are untouched.
/*.png

# run_end_to_end.mjs writes these two next to the app. The .png is covered above; the log is
# not, and an untracked file in the way is no better than a modified one.
/end_to_end_result_log.json
